### newLabReports

POST /users/@me/reports HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{newSession.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Host: {{host}}

{
  "sampleNo": "IF110390",
  "date": "2025-06-11 08:52 AM",
  "specimen": "Stool",
  "tests": [
    {
      "testName": "H. Pylori Antigen Test ",
      "result": "Positive",
      "conversionFactor": "Immunochromatogra phy"
    }
  ]
}

### newLabReports

POST /users/@me/reports HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{newSession.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Host: {{host}}

{
  "sampleNo": "asldkjasdasld",
  "date": "2025-05-14",
  "specimen": "Plasma",
  "tests": [
    {
      "testName": "Glucose F",
      "result": "98",
      "unit": "mg/dL",
      "referenceRange": "60 - 110",
      "method": "HEXOKINASE",
